==========================================================
16. CONCLUSION
==========================================================

A Content-Based Movie Recommendation System was successfully developed using Natural Language Processing techniques.

The system processes movie storylines, converts textual information into numerical vectors using TF-IDF, calculates similarity using Cosine Similarity, and recommends the top 5 most relevant movies.

The project demonstrates the practical application of NLP and Machine Learning techniques in recommendation systems and provides an interactive Streamlit-based user interface.

